WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:03.180
This seat taken?

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:05.500
I'll just get a glass of water, please.

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:08.360
I have to save all my money 
cuz I'm here to find my sister.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.540
She's been taken.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:10.580
Taken? Like...

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:15.640
Like by men who sell hot white virgins to 
kajillionaires on yachts.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.400
I am very moved by your story. Order anything you like.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:23.680
I'll have a club sandwich and 
an order fries, two slices of cake.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:24.840
Do you want any cake? 
No.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:26.960
Three slices of cake and a diet coke.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:28.480
Impressive.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:29.831
I'm a con artist.

00:00:29.831 --> 00:00:31.259
Sisters in arms.

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:35.480
I had no idea how small time I was until I met you.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:38.460
Penny, why are women better suited to
 the con than men?

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:40.000
Because we're used to faking it?

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:44.780
Because no man will ever believe 
a woman is smarter than he is.

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:45.800
Is it valuable?

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.000
$500,000.

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:49.000
I like it cuz it's shiny.

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:54.080
I could be the partner you never knew you needed.

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:55.740
Teach me your sugar baby ways!

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:57.880
Take this to the guest room butler-y person!

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:06.540
First lesson: there's nothing more compelling to a man than a vulnerable woman. Observe.

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.140
Wow, you can just tear up like that.

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:13.900
Can you make the tear roll down your cheek? Oh, oh!

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:14.860
Now, you try.

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:18.820
Are you constipated?

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:26.840
If you want to be like me, 
you must be trained for any situation.

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:32.960
She's ready.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:34.080
Yes!

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:35.280
Who's the mark?

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:36.640
He's a tech millionaire.

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:37.940
Billionaire, I bet.

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:40.320
Try to be as inconspicuous as possible.

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:41.500
Coming through.

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:44.320
Yep, blind person walking here.

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:46.020
If this person would just scoot over,

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.720
would you mind, sir? Sir?

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:58.380
Men always underestimate us, and that is what we use.

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:05.120
You let her get away.

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:10.960
Trashy dress, you did it again.

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:15.120
Release the peasants!

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:16.900
She must mean pheasants, yes?

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:18.880
Don't worry, darling. She's a terrible shot.

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:25.440
That was unexpected.

